{"id":"asesino","lemma":"asesino","pos":"noun","rank":460,"glosses":["murderer, killer (person who commits murder)","assassin","traitor"],"ipa":"/aseˈsino/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"asesinos","feminine":"asesina","femininePlural":"asesinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-asesino.wav","formAudio":{"asesina":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-asesina.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"«¡Eres un asesino!» «¡No, no lo soy!»","en":"\"You're a murderer!\" \"No, I'm not!\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687719","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"}]},{"text":"Tú no eres asesino y yo tampoco.","en":"You're not a killer and neither am I.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"neither"}]},{"text":"Tom es un asesino.","en":"Tom is a murderer.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El asesino aún no ha sido atrapado.","en":"The murderer is still at large.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"caught"}]},{"text":"Puedo demostrar quién es el asesino.","en":"I can prove who the murderer is.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to show"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}